    "intro": {
      "zh": "Game Boy Color 是任天堂于 1998 年发布的掌上游戏机，也是首款彩色 Game Boy。它在继承初代 Game Boy 竖版机身与经典十字键、A/B 键布局的基础上，将绿点阵屏升级为彩色液晶屏，向下兼容 GB 卡带，并凭借宝可梦等作品掀起热潮，是 Game Boy 谱系彩色升级的关键节点。",
      "en": "The Game Boy Color, released by Nintendo in 1998, was the first color Game Boy. Building on the vertical form factor and classic D-pad/A-B layout of the original Game Boy, it upgraded the green dot-matrix screen to a color LCD, remained backward compatible with GB cartridges, and rode the Pokémon wave to become a key milestone in the Game Boy lineage."
    },
    "era": 1998, "manufacturer": "Nintendo"
  },
